From 216a658651240998289792bc5037a28cb2250485 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shawn Abtey <exerostasis@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 14:28:38 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(machines): built-in Makera Z1 Pro posting through the
 Carvera post

The Z1 Pro is the Z1 frame (200x200x100 mm, 150 W, 13000 rpm, Air M7)
with ball screws and a 2000 mm/min feed and rapid ceiling, from Makera's
public Z1 page. The machine file names the shared Carvera post. The
makera_z1 tests now cover the two models.

Fixes #4434

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
